            "renamePattern": "$1"
          }
        }
      ],
      "description": "Prometheus labels rule_group as \"<rules-file-path>;<group-name>\" - stripped to just the group name via a rename transform. Sub-2ms across all four groups is healthy; a sustained climb toward the 15s evaluation_interval would mean rules are falling behind."
